OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APolice search for two thieves who stole
OL,4,ARenoir paintings worth millions from
OL,5,AFrench museum
OL,6,
OL,7,FAccording to French media, the four
OL,8,Fstolen paintings were: Portrait of
OL,9,FMadame Pichon (1895); Coco Lisant
OL,10,F(1905); Portrait of Madame Colonna
OL,11,FRomano (1910), and Jeune fille au puits
OL,12,F(1886) - see them all here. The latter
OL,13,Ftwo are still missing
OL,15,FThe thieves triggered the alarm at
OL,16,F05:48 local time (04:48 BST) after
OL,17,Fentering the museum gardens by cutting
OL,18,Fthrough a fence. Police arrived five
OL,19,Fminutes later
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
