OL,3,APolice search for two thieves who stole
OL,4,ARenoir paintings worth millions from
OL,5,AFrench museum
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, the mayor's office said the
OL,8,Festimated value of the stolen art was
OL,9,FbB,9m (#7.7m; $10.5m)
